message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SimpleKiteControllers.jl"
abstract: "Controllers for kites used in airborne wind energy systems. Provides a path-following figure-of-eight controller with gain-scheduled course control, a reel-out controller that produces power by reeling out while flying figures of eight, a parking controller, a curvature feasibility check for flight paths, and a client for the AWETrim reel-out flight-path optimizer."
